      // Cu-O 1.98 Å (Hofmann 1994, as cited by Gomes & Gomes, J. Mol. Struct. Theochem 503 (2000) 189, Table 1); with Cu-Cu 2.556 Å it puts O 1.32 Å above the Cu plane, Hofmann's measured height.
